and understand that it's gonna be okay

1829
01:24:32.130 --> 01:24:35.140
and that everything must change.

1830
01:24:35.140 --> 01:24:37.750
Everything has to go through a transformation.

1831
01:24:37.750 --> 01:24:39.980
And so, because I don't like suffering,

1832
01:24:39.980 --> 01:24:43.360
I want you to do it in the most gentle way possible.

1833
01:24:43.360 --> 01:24:46.170
I don't like humans to suffer.

1834
01:24:46.170 --> 01:24:48.960
I also think we should refrain

1835
01:24:48.960 --> 01:24:51.110
from an old idea of a patterning

1836
01:24:51.110 --> 01:24:54.540
that means X when someone breaks up.

1837
01:24:54.540 --> 01:24:57.230
That we can do this, people make fun of it.

1838
01:24:57.230 --> 01:24:59.247
You know, "Oh, I'm consciously uncoupling.

1839
01:24:59.247 --> 01:25:00.470
"Like, oh, that's so funny."

1840
01:25:00.470 --> 01:25:02.100
But it's actually,

1841
01:25:02.100 --> 01:25:06.000
if you really love somebody and you really love them,

1842
01:25:06.000 --> 01:25:10.430
then you would want what is best for them in all places,

1843
01:25:10.430 --> 01:25:12.930
in all stages of their life.

1844
01:25:12.930 --> 01:25:17.340
And you and I, our vows were to support each other

1845
01:25:17.340 --> 01:25:20.150
to realize our greatest dreams.

1846
01:25:20.150 --> 01:25:22.280
That was what we said.

1847
01:25:22.280 --> 01:25:24.690
And I think we've done that.

1848
01:25:24.690 --> 01:25:27.160
I think we've held up to that.

1849
01:25:27.160 --> 01:25:32.160
And every relationship is changing and moving.

1850
01:25:32.170 --> 01:25:35.120
It's not about where you were or the old story.

1851
01:25:35.120 --> 01:25:37.520
It's about who are we today

1852
01:25:37.520 --> 01:25:39.270
and what are we doing going forward

1853
01:25:39.270 --> 01:25:42.600
and what is left to be uncovered inside of me?

1854
01:25:42.600 --> 01:25:45.230
What is left to be uncovered inside of you?

1855
01:25:45.230 --> 01:25:47.093
And how can we support that?

1856
01:25:48.150 --> 01:25:53.150
So, I think it's all about you and you.

1857
01:25:53.450 --> 01:25:56.720
It's this deep communion with your own self.

1858
01:25:56.720 --> 01:25:59.470
And when you learn to advocate for yourself,

1859
01:25:59.470 --> 01:26:00.910
then you will make choices

1860
01:26:00.910 --> 01:26:04.420
that are considering yourself first,

1861
01:26:04.420 --> 01:26:08.450
which is rather contrary to the way we've been raised.

1862
01:26:08.450 --> 01:26:12.150
We think it's spiritual to martyr yourself, but no.

1863
01:26:12.150 --> 01:26:14.383
The martyr doesn't help anybody in the end.

1864
01:26:15.960 --> 01:26:20.130
So, wouldn't it be better to just honor yourself?

1865
01:26:20.130 --> 01:26:23.170
And you'll find out that if you start treating yourself

1866
