1877
01:26:55.340 --> 01:27:00.340
And that's the upside-down way of going about it.

1878
01:27:00.340 --> 01:27:02.380
Be the person, become the person.

1879
01:27:02.380 --> 01:27:05.152
Commit yourself to becoming the person

1880
